{"id":"turning-point-generation-9-11-tmdb-1752159","type":"MOVIE","category":"STREAMING","title":"Turning Point: Generation 9/11","overview":"Veinticinco años después del 11-S, este documental analiza cómo aquel fatídico día marcó a toda una nueva generación. Desde los niños que perdieron a sus padres en los atentados a los periodistas que dieron sus primeros pasos profesionales cubriendo la guerra contra el terrorismo, pasando por los jóvenes afganos y marines que sufrieron las consecuencias de la caótica retirada de EE. UU. de Afganistán: sus estremecedores testimonios muestran que el legado del 11-S no se mide solo por su trascendencia histórica, sino por las vidas que aún sigue marcando.","releaseDate":"2026-09-03","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peEW3aQtOacOqGOB88LkDT6QGvQ.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/z2Uf0yntMjY0XG87YfoqeHjIUGD.jpg","genres":["Documental"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/z2Uf0yntMjY0XG87YfoqeHjIUGD.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oHvNmKakGfykkvYeNXSy33ITxzD.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/irf3bek3ttLdDHVa4984GFPdxBS.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/h0lbn2aVNPkXxcmp4ym33WPUYZC.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9IY6zP97QQF2oxdBZ693bTVr1aZ.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":6.1},"availability":{"platforms":["Netflix","Netflix Standard with Ads"]},"cast":[{"name":"Michael Smoak","role":"Self","personTmdbId":6464972,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Garrett M. Graff","role":"Self","personTmdbId":3630038,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Anand Gopal","role":"Self","personTmdbId":6464973,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Jenny Pachucki","role":"Self","personTmdbId":3697229,"department":"Production"},{"name":"Bruce Hoffman","role":"Self","personTmdbId":3629203,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Osama bin Lad